>> title: Brownies
>> part: Desserts

= Recipe

Melt butter over stove in pan.

@unsalted butter{113%g|1%stick}

Remove heat then mix in cocoa and sugar.

@cocoa powder{32%g|6%tbsp}
@sugar{198%g|1%cup}

Beat in eggs one at a time.

@eggs{2}

Mix in remaining ingredients:

@vanilla extract{5%g|1%tsp}
@flour{90%g|3/4%cup}
@salt{2%g|1/4%tsp}

Optionally add chocolate chips or chopped nuts.

@chocolate chips or chopped nuts{1%handfull}

Pour batter into a {{8 x 8%}} glass baking dish.

Bake for 30 minutes at {{350%°F}}.

Let cool for 10 minutes before serving.
